  "problem": "$\\text{Var}[{e}^{2}]=$",
  "worked_solution": "Recall that for any constant $a,$ we have\n\n$$\n\\text{Var}[a]=0.\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\text{Var}[{e}^{2}]=0.\n$$",
